      "text": "• dallas-permit-chat client UI\n• AadHttpClientFactory token acquisition\n• Scope: api://<apiClientId>/access_as_user\n• Calls POST /api/chat with Bearer JWT\n• Transparent SSO, zero secondary login\n• Property pane: endpoint & App ID config",
